<title>USA: Florida investors cut Eljer stake.</title>
<headline>Florida investors cut Eljer stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Naples, Fla., investor James Lennane and Betty Byouk said Wednesday they reduced their stake in Eljer Industries Inc to 626,300 common shares or 8.754 percent of the total outstanding.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the two investors said they sold 84,200 shares between July 8 and October 1 at prices ranging from $9.625 to $10.6812 a share.</p>
</text>
